A.6 Civilisational Context (C)

Code Indicator Source
C1 Baseline elite political violence rate per decade Seshat, HRAF
C2 Baseline elite childhood mortality and child‑rearing norms Seshat, HRAF
C3 Legitimate violence norms Ethnographic/historical surveys

C variables serve as reference distributions for DAD and human‑cost normalisation and as random effects or control variables capturing shared cultural inheritance (Galton’s Problem).

